   "idx": 3,
   "zh": "大家好！欢迎亚太工商界的朋友们！很高兴同大家在深圳见面。",
   "en": "Good morning! I wish to extend my welcome to you all, leaders of business communities of the Asia-Pacific. I am so delighted to meet you here in Shenzhen.",
