  {
   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "南海之滨，风劲潮涌。40多年来，深圳在中国改革开放春潮中勇立潮头、奋发进取，实现了从边陲小镇到国际化大都市的历史性跨越，创造了世界发展史上的一个奇迹。深圳的成功，给人们许多启示。",
   "en": "Shenzhen, on the shores of the South China Sea, embraces the surging winds and waves of the ocean. Over the past 40 years and more, Shenzhen has been a pioneer in China’s pursuit of reform and opening up. It has achieved a historic transformation from a small border town into an international metropolis, creating a miracle in the history of global development. There is so much people can draw from Shenzhen’s success.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
