  {
   "idx": 5,
   "zh": "当前，国际形势变乱交织，世界经济增长动能不足，单边主义、保护主义甚嚣尘上。与此同时，全球贸易在逆势中保持增长，新兴技术加速突破，深刻影响世界发展格局。世界怎么了？亚太怎么办？开放还是封闭，合作还是分化，变革还是守旧？都是我们必须回答的时代课题。",
   "en": "Today, we find ourselves in a changing and turbulent world. Global growth lacks momentum, and unilateralism and protectionism are rampant. Still, global trade keeps growing against headwinds, and breakthroughs are being made in emerging technologies at a faster pace, exerting a profound impact on global development. What is going on with the world? What should we do in the Asia-Pacific? To open doors or close doors, work together or against each other, adapt to change or stick to old ways? These are hard questions of our times that we must answer.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    22,
    22
   ],
   "ep": [
    23,
    23
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 6,
   "zh": "凡益之道，与时偕行。亚太经合组织伴随经济全球化浪潮而生，推动亚太地区引领时代风气之先。今年，中国第三次担任亚太经合组织东道主。中方愿同各方一道，坚定信心、勇毅前行，携手建设亚太共同体，促进亚太共同繁荣。",
   "en": "As an ancient Chinese saying goes, all approaches should adapt to changing times to remain relevant. Born amid the waves of economic globalization, APEC has enabled the Asia-Pacific to steer the course of our times. This year, China is hosting APEC for the third time. We are ready to work with all other parties to forge ahead with resolve, jointly build an Asia-Pacific community, and bring prosperity for all in our region.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    25,
    25
   ],
   "ep": [
    26,
    26
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "zh": "——促进亚太共同繁荣，要维护和平稳定大局。稳，才能安；安，才能兴。亚太经济保持稳中向好，成为全球经济增长的重要引擎，得益于长期稳定的地区环境。越是外部形势复杂，我们越要坚定维护战后国际秩序，推进平等有序的世界多极化、普惠包容的经济全球化；越要坚持通过对话协商解决分歧，通过团结协作应对挑战，为亚太地区长治久安筑牢根基。",
   "en": "—To bring prosperity for all in the Asia-Pacific, we should uphold peace and stability. There can be no prosperity without security, and no security without stability. Thanks to the stable environment in our region over the past decades, the Asia-Pacific has maintained steady economic progress and become an important engine driving global growth. The more complex the external conditions become, the more important it is for us to uphold the postwar international order, and promote an equality-based and orderly multipolar world and economic globalization that is inclusive and brings benefit to all. It is even more important for us to resolve differences through dialogue and consultation, and overcome challenges through solidarity and cooperation. This is the way to cement the foundation for sustaining peace and stability in the Asia-Pacific.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    28,
    28
   ],
   "ep": [
    29,
    29
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "zh": "——促进亚太共同繁荣，要搭建开放合作桥梁。历史经验证明，开放带来进步，封闭必然落后。我们要坚定维护以世界贸易组织为核心、以规则为基础的多边贸易体制，支持自由开放的贸易和投资，维护全球产业链供应链稳定畅通。稳步推进亚太自由贸易区进程，搭建全方位互联互通网络，加强贸易数字化、跨境电商、智慧海关等合作，深化产业链供应链国际合作，为亚太经济一体化建设铺路架桥。",
   "en": "—To bring prosperity for all in the Asia-Pacific, we should build bridges of opening up and cooperation. History tells us that opening doors brings progress while closing doors leaves one behind. We should firmly safeguard the WTO-centered, rules-based multilateral trading system, support free and open trade and investment, and keep global industrial and supply chains stable and unimpeded. We should work steadily toward a Free Trade Area of the Asia-Pacific, build a multidimensional connectivity network, enhance cooperation in areas such as digital transformation of trade, cross-border e-commerce, and smart customs, and deepen international cooperation on industrial and supply chains. All this will pave the way for greater economic integration in the Asia-Pacific.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
    31,
    31
   ],
   "ep": [
    32,
    32
   ]
  },
  {
   "idx": 9,
   "zh": "——促进亚太共同繁荣，要激发创新增长动力。创新是推动社会进步的重要力量。亚太经合组织成员在全球科技创新中锐意进取，独角兽企业、人工智能大模型蓬勃涌现，一大批创新成果赋能千行百业、走进千家万户。我们要积极构建科技创新伙伴关系，深化数字经济、人工智能合作，促进绿色低碳转型，不断将创新优势转化为增长动能，为亚太经济增长提供强劲动力。",
   "en": "—To bring prosperity for all in the Asia-Pacific, we should boost innovation to drive growth. Innovation is crucial for progress. APEC members have driven global scientific and technological innovation: Unicorn companies and large AI models have emerged in large numbers, and many innovations have empowered hundreds of trades and industries and reached millions of households. We should forge science, technology and innovation partnerships, deepen cooperation in the digital economy and AI, and promote green and low-carbon transition. By doing so, we can turn strengths in innovation into drivers of growth, and provide strong impetus for economic growth in the Asia-Pacific.",
   "kind": "para",
   "zp": [
