  },
  {
   "idx": 10,
   "zh": "——促进亚太共同繁荣，要拓展互利共赢路径。亚太各经济体历史文化和发展阶段不尽相同，推进合作不能搞整齐划一。要既消除贸易和投资壁垒，建设开放型亚太经济，又推动普惠均衡发展，兼顾效率和公平。要坚持以人民为中心的发展理念，面向发展中经济体加强经济技术合作，深化交通运输、公共卫生、能源、粮食安全、反腐败等合作，让发展成果惠及各经济体和不同的阶层及人群。",
   "en": "—To bring prosperity for all in the Asia-Pacific, we should expand our ways for mutual benefits and win-win outcomes. As the economies in our region differ in history, culture and stage of development, taking a uniform approach will not advance cooperation. We should remove trade and investment barriers to build an open Asia-Pacific economy. At the same time, we should promote development that is balanced and delivers benefits to all to ensure both efficiency and fairness. We should follow a people-centered development philosophy, strengthen economic and technical cooperation geared for developing economies, and deepen cooperation in transportation, public health, energy, food security, anti-corruption and other fields, so that development fruits are shared by all economies and all groups and communities.",
   "kind": "para",
