   "idx": 11,
   "zh": "亚太地区汇集了世界上最重要的湾区，湾区经济具有鲜明的开放性、协同性、外溢性。我们所在的深圳就位于粤港澳大湾区。中方支持成立世界湾区经济合作联盟，深化各湾区交流互动，探索亚太经济合作新路径。",
   "en": "The Asia-Pacific region is home to the world’s most important bay areas notable for their open and interconnected economies with positive spillover effects. Shenzhen, where we are now meeting, is part of the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area. China supports the establishment of a World Association for Bay Areas Economic Cooperation to deepen exchanges and interactions among bay areas from across the world. This will help us explore new ways for stronger economic cooperation in the Asia-Pacific.",
