   "idx": 13,
   "zh": "今年是中国“十五五”开局之年。当前，中国经济保持向新向优向好发展态势，展现出强大韧性和活力。前三季度，中国经济增速达到4.6%，新质生产力加速发展，新发展格局加快构建，绿色低碳转型蹄疾步稳，“十五五”开局良好。中国“十五五”规划既是自身的发展蓝图，也为亚太乃至全球经济增长提供机遇清单，是中国面向全球工商界发出的合作邀约。",
   "en": "This year marks the start of China’s 15th Five-Year Plan for economic and social development. China’s economy maintains a strong momentum of high-quality, innovation-driven growth, demonstrating great resilience and vitality. In the first three quarters, the Chinese economy grew by 4.6 percent. New quality productive forces are developing more quickly, the new development pattern is being fostered at a faster pace, and green and low-carbon transition is steadily picking up speed. The 15th Five-Year Plan has gotten off to a good start. A blueprint for China’s development, the 15th Five-Year Plan also provides a list of opportunities for promoting economic growth in the Asia-Pacific and the wider world. Indeed, it is an invitation for cooperation China has sent to business communities from around the world.",
