   "idx": 14,
   "zh": "——中国将为全球工商界提供超大规模的开放市场。中国是全球第二大消费市场，拥有全球规模最大的中等收入群体，投资和消费潜力巨大。从新能源汽车到智能家居，从银发经济到冰雪旅游，每一个新赛道都为全球企业带来新机遇。中国正在加快建设开放大市场，扩大优质产品和服务进口，将不断催生多样化新需求。几天前，第九届中国国际进口博览会在上海举办，在座很多工商界朋友都前往参加，发现了新的合作机遇。中国还将继续举办“出口中国”等系列活动，搭建各国优质商品进入中国市场的高效通道。",
   "en": "—China will provide global business communities with a super-sized open market. China is the world’s second largest consumer market. It has the largest middle income group in the world and enormous potential for investment and consumption. From new energy vehicles to smart homes, from the silver economy to ice and snow tourism, every new growth area is creating new opportunities for businesses across the world. As China accelerates the development of a big, open market and increases import of quality products and services, more diverse demands will be unleashed. Recently, the ninth China International Import Expo was held in Shanghai. Many of you present today attended the Expo and found new cooperation opportunities. China will also continue to host “Export to China” series and other events to open efficient channels to help quality products from across the world enter the Chinese market.",
   "kind": "para",
