   "idx": 15,
   "zh": "——中国将为全球工商界提供前景广阔的发展空间。创新驱动、绿色转型是中国经济的关键词。从机器人“进场打工”，到机器狗“下乡务农”，再到自动驾驶和无人机外卖，中国超大规模创新试验场让前沿技术在真实场景中接受检验、迭代打磨，不断转化为高质量发展活力。中国将加快构建现代化产业体系，推动科技创新和产业创新深度融合，支持传统产业转型升级、新兴产业发展壮大、未来产业前瞻布局，为全球企业技术创新和发展壮大提供强劲动能。",
   "en": "—China will provide global business communities with a promising land for development. Innovation-driven growth and green transition are the key words in observing China’s economy. From factory and farm robots, to autonomous driving and drone delivery, China is a super-sized innovation testing ground where frontier technologies are tested, improved and upgraded in real-world scenarios, and are then turned into high-quality growth drivers. China will step up efforts to build a modernized industrial system, and deepen integration between technological and industrial innovation. It will support the transformation and upgrading of traditional industries, the expansion of emerging industries, and the forward-looking planning of industries of the future. This will generate strong impetus for technological innovation and growth of businesses around the world.",
