   "idx": 16,
   "zh": "——中国将为全球工商界提供互促共进的合作环境。2001年，中国首次举办亚太经合组织领导人非正式会议，同年加入世界贸易组织。25年来，中国全面履行“入世”承诺，在实现自身发展的同时同世界各国共享机遇、共促发展。面对单边主义、保护主义冲击，中国始终践行真正的多边主义，坚定维护多边贸易体制，维护世贸组织规则，推动世贸组织改革，不断为世界经济增长和国际经贸合作注入稳定性和确定性。无论国际风云如何变幻，中国同世界各国合作共赢的决心都不会改变。中方坚定不移推动共建“一带一路”高质量发展，欢迎亚太地区企业积极参与，共谋发展机遇、共享发展成果。中方将从降低关税、扩大准入，到探索规则、管理、标准等深水区改革，全面落实制造业准入又准营，稳步扩大服务业领域开放，为全球企业来华投资兴业提供更稳定、更可预期的优质环境。",
   "en": "—China will provide global business communities with an environment that enables mutually reinforcing cooperation. In 2001, China hosted the APEC Economic Leaders’ Meeting for the first time and joined the World Trade Organization in the same year. Over the past 25 years, China has fully honored its WTO accession commitments. While pursuing its own development, China has shared opportunities with other countries and worked for common development. China has stood up to unilateralism and protectionism, and remained committed to true multilateralism, to upholding the multilateral trading system and WTO rules, and to advancing WTO reform; it has steadily brought stability and predictability to world economic growth and international trade and economic cooperation. No matter how the international landscape may evolve, China will not waver in its pursuit of win-win cooperation with all other countries. China stays firmly committed to high-quality Belt and Road cooperation, and welcomes the active participation of businesses from across the Asia-Pacific so that we can create growth opportunities and share the fruits of development together. China will not only cut tariffs and expand market access but also go a step further—we will carry out reform in challenging areas, such as rules, regulation and standards, in order to fully ensure market access and an accommodating operating environment in the manufacturing sector, to steadily expand opening up in the service sector, and to foster a more stable and more predictable first-class environment for companies from around the world to invest and do business in China.",
