  {
   "idx": 18,
   "zh": "亚太是我们共同发展的天地，也是我们并肩合作的舞台。亚太工商界是全球经济的弄潮儿。希望大家发扬勇于创新、追求卓越的企业家精神，积极拓展商业合作机遇，为推进亚太经济一体化作出更大贡献。欢迎大家继续积极参与中国改革开放和现代化建设，共享中国式现代化机遇。",
   "en": "The Asia-Pacific is our home; it is here we jointly pursue development and cooperation. Asia-Pacific business communities are pioneers of the global economy. I hope you will carry forward the entrepreneurial spirit, boldly pursue innovation and excellence, explore and expand opportunities for business cooperation, and make greater contributions to economic integration in the Asia-Pacific. You are more than welcome to continue to get actively involved in China’s reform and opening up and modernization drive, and share in the opportunities created by Chinese modernization.",
